# Large regenerable FEA intermediates/results - regenerate via:
#   gmsh <case>.geo -3 -o mesh_raw.inp -format inp   (mesh)
#   ccx analysis                                      (solve, produces .frd/.dat)
# Reproducibility comes from the tracked .geo/.inp files + scripts,
# not from committing multi-hundred-MB binary results.
mesh_raw.inp
mesh_hex.inp
*_clean.inp
mesh_clean.inp
*.frd
*.dat

